===Death of Kagutsuchi===
After the agony, Izanami dies. At the time Izanagi crept moaning about the body and mourned her death. From his tears {{nihongo|Nakisawame|泣 沢 女神}} was born. Subsequently Izanagi buries Izanami on [[Mount Hiba]]

